Cell["\<\
The partial derivative of signatory indirect utility wrt qn (qs at optimal) \
times the partial derivative of non-signatory effort wrt a\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.914470284093783*^9, 3.914470286897196*^9}},
