Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Strategic Use of Eta", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.905908516367024*^9, 3.90590852031535*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Courier",
 FontSize->13,
 FontWeight->"Regular",ExpressionUUID->"420cce9a-ce34-416b-9344-5320ed28033c"],

Cell["\<\
In this section, we assume N-1 countries set their truthful expectations \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]eta\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] while one country is \
strategically setting its expectations. Thus, we have a case of heterogenous \
expectations. In this supporting file, we first solve the game with possibly \
two types of countries different in their expectations, which we call them \
low and high expectations here. Then, assume that there is only one country \
of one of the types.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.905908534198297*^9, 3.90590870904624*^9}, {
   3.9059087585463753`*^9, 3.905908769650374*^9}, {3.919725748639592*^9, 
   3.919725755153208*^9}, 3.919728807021796*^9},
 FontFamily->"Courier",
 FontSize->13,
 FontWeight->"Regular",ExpressionUUID->"f88332c1-89a5-415f-953b-11353358fd04"],

Cell["\<\
Let the number of countries be N, low types be l and, thus, the high types be \
N-l. Among k signatories, k_L and k_H be the number of low and high types,  \
respectively.
The utility under symmetry, the equation (7): U(b, c, \[Alpha], \[Eta], N, \
q_i, Q_-i) = b(Q_-i + qi) - (c/2)(qi)^2 +\[Alpha](Q_-i/(N -1) - \[Eta])(q_i \
+1 - \[Eta])
Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s solve the non-cooperative game.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9059087251172657`*^9, 3.905908731130632*^9}, {
  3.905908887056362*^9, 3.905908898385016*^9}, {3.9197288607491417`*^9, 
  3.919728860804576*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Courier",
 FontSize->13,
 FontWeight->"Regular",ExpressionUUID->"ca50dbc9-90a3-4340-9e02-1f385a716e97"],

Cell["The utility function of a country with LOW EXPECTATIONS is:", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.905908908538376*^9, 3.90590891106348*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Courier",
 FontSize->13,
 FontWeight->"Regular",ExpressionUUID->"0de64556-4c25-4962-bacf-bad1b2931440"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"utilitynoncooplowetai", "[", 
   RowBox[{
   "b_", ",", " ", "c_", ",", " ", "\[Alpha]_", ",", " ", "\[Eta]L_", ",", 
    "\[Eta]H_", ",", " ", "n_", ",", "l_", ",", " ", "qLn_", ",", "qHn_", ",",
     "qLi_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"b", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"n", "-", "l"}], ")"}], "qHn"}], "+", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"l", "-", "1"}], ")"}], "qLn"}], "+", "qLi"}], ")"}]}], "-", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"c", "/", "2"}], ")"}], 
    RowBox[{"qLi", "^", "2"}]}], "+", 
   RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"n", "-", "l"}], ")"}], "qHn"}], "+", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"l", "-", "1"}], ")"}], "qLn"}]}], ")"}], "/", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"n", "-", "1"}], ")"}]}], "-", "\[Eta]L"}], ")"}], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"qLi", "+", "1", "-", "\[Eta]H"}], ")"}]}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9059089213690643`*^9},
 FontFamily->"Courier",
 FontWeight->"Regular",
 CellLabel->
  "In[103]:=",ExpressionUUID->"4d33752a-204c-4d35-a037-205c746ac588"],

