Cell[TextData[{
 "The first two equations below show the optimal strategic eta \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]\[Eta]L\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] for some specific \
parameter values and in particular how it changes with the truthful \
expectations \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]\[Eta]H\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. The last \
two equations show the effort levels of the strategic and non-strategic \
countries. We evaluate these equations for a wide range of parameters and \
shared our findings on ",
 StyleBox["equation (18), result 2 and the paragraph between the two.",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontSize->13,
  FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.905909633634282*^9, 3.905909652680388*^9}, {
