to exert zero effort:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9059911376973057`*^9, 3.9059911503357573`*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Courier",
 FontSize->13,
 FontWeight->"Regular",ExpressionUUID->"47bc5156-8250-460f-8636-18d64f168656"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

